# http://ns.inria.fr/ecocontrol/ontology/hasLethality
<http://ns.inria.fr/ecocontrol/ontology/hasLethality> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<http://ns.inria.fr/ecocontrol/ontology/hasLethality> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> _:genid75 .
