<http://ns.inria.fr/ecocontrol/ontology/TaxonInStage> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://ns.inria.fr/ecocontrol/ontology/TaxonInStage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://ns.inria.fr/ecocontrol/ontology/Taxon> .
<http://ns.inria.fr/ecocontrol/ontology/TaxonInStage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A subset of a taxon with only individuals at a certain development stage." .
